# API server / Ray driver venv (CPU).
#
# Scope:
# - Installed into a host venv (for example on `mint-dev` driver).
# - Used by the API server process and by Ray driver utilities (ray start/join, ray.init).
# - NOT used by GPU workers (those use the Mint Docker image).
#
# Notes:
# - Must include `torch` on the driver to deserialize tensors from Ray object store.
# - Must keep `ray` version aligned with the cluster.
# - Python patch version must match the Ray cluster Python exactly (Ray is strict).

